---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: What We Carry
description: Día de los Muertos décor, longhorns, pottery, Mexican figurines and rustic furniture at 3 Brothers Shop in downtown Las Cruces.
permalink: /shop/
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <p class="script">Lo que tenemos</p>
    <h1>What We Carry</h1>
    <p>New pieces arrive all the time. Stop by the shop or follow us on Instagram to see the latest.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="parchment section">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="category-grid">
      {% for category in categories.list %}{% include "components/category-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section news-strip">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <header class="section-head section-head--light">
      <p class="script">Fotos</p>
      <h2>Around the Shop</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="gallery">
      {% for item in gallery.list %}
      <figure><img src="{{ item.image }}" alt="{{ item.caption }}" loading="lazy"><figcaption>{{ item.caption }}</figcaption></figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "components/visit.njk" %}
